#: main.cpp:67
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Another instance of %1 is already running. Do you really want to open "
"another instance or continue work in the same instance?\n"
"Please note that, unfortunately, duplicate views are read-only."
msgstr ""
"Užo pracuje inšaja kopija prahramy „%1”. Sapraŭdy treba adčynić inšuju "
"kopiju albo praciahvać pracavać u toj samaj kopii?\n"
"Nažal, paŭtornyja kopii dastupnyja tolki dla čytańnia."

