#: main.cpp:119
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "A unique name that represents this bookmark collection, usually the "
#| "kinstance name.\n"
#| "This should be \"konqueror\" for the Konqueror bookmarks, \"kfile\" for "
#| "KFileDialog bookmarks, etc.\n"
#| "The final DBus object path is /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"
msgid ""
"A unique name that represents this bookmark collection, usually the "
"kinstance name.\n"
"This should be \"konqueror\" for the Konqueror bookmarks, \"kfile\" for "
"KFileDialog bookmarks, etc.\n"
"The final D-Bus object path is /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"
msgstr ""
"Niepaŭtornaja nazva, jakaja identyfikuje hety zbor zakładak, zvyčajna heta "
"nazva „kinstance”.\n"
"Heta „konqueror” dla zakładak prahramy „Konqueror”, „kfile” dla zakładak "
"dyjalohavych voknaŭ „KFileDialog” itp.\n"
"Kančatkovaja ściežka abjekta „D-Bus”: /KBookmarkManager/dbusObjectName"

